WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.509
Prefixes attach before a root word; re-, un- and dis- can change meaning.

00:00:05.367 --> 00:00:08.865
What does re- usually suggest in “rewrite”? Answer: Write again

00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:13.967
Build and explain three words with prefixes, such as retell and unhappy.

00:00:14.783 --> 00:00:17.045
Discuss why: Re- commonly means again.
